signal composed by the activity from caller "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"abortSignal"},{"type":"text","value":"\nand/or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"timeout"},{"type":"text","value":". Adapters should forward this to the provider SDK when\nsupported. Request-specific — never store on a global client config."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"logger","children":[{"type":"text","value":"logger"}]},{"type":"code","value":"logger: InternalLogger;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2174","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2174"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Internal logger threaded from the generateImage() entry point. Adapters must\ncall logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in catch blocks."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"model","children":[{"type":"text","value":"model"}]},{"type":"code","value":"model: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2153","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2153"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The model to use for image generation"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"modeloptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"modelOptions?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2169","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2169"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Model-specific options for image generation"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"numberofimages","children":[{"type":"text","value":"numberOfImages?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional numberOfImages?: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2165","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2165"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Number of images to generate (default: 1)"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"prompt","children":[{"type":"text","value":"prompt"}]},{"type":"code","value":"prompt: MediaPrompt;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2163","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2163"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description of the desired image(s): a plain string, or an ordered array\nof content parts for image-conditioned generation (image-to-image,\nreference-guided, edit, multi-reference). Media parts may carry\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"metadata.role"},{"type":"text","value":" to disambiguate intent (mask, control, reference, …).\nAdapters map parts onto the provider-native request — e.g. Gemini\nmultimodal "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"contents"},{"type":"text","value":", OpenAI "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"images.edit()"},{"type":"text","value":", fal "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"image_url"},{"type":"text","value":" /\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mask_url"},{"type":"text","value":" — and throw a clear runtime error for unsupported modalities."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"size","children":[{"type":"text","value":"size?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional size?: TSize;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2167","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2167"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image size in WIDTHxHEIGHT format (e.g., \"1024x1024\")"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tprovideroptions","text":"TProviderOptions","level":3},{"id":"tsize","text":"TSize","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"abortsignal","text":"abortSignal?","level":3},{"id":"logger","text":"logger","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3},{"id":"modeloptions","text":"modelOptions?","level":3},{"id":"numberofimages","text":"numberOfImages?","level":3},{"id":"prompt","text":"prompt","level":3},{"id":"size","text":"size?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2148](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2148)\n\nOptions for image generation.\nThese are the common options supported across providers.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `object`\n\n### TSize\n\n`TSize` *extends* `string` \\| `undefined` = `string`\n\n## Properties\n\n### abortSignal?\n\n```ts\noptional abortSignal?: AbortSignal;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2180](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2180)\n\nEffective abort signal composed by the activity from caller `abortSignal`\nand/or `timeout`. Adapters should forward this to the provider SDK when\nsupported. Request-specific — never store on a global client config.\n\n***\n\n### logger\n\n```ts\nlogger: InternalLogger;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2174](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2174)\n\nInternal logger threaded from the generateImage() entry point. Adapters must\ncall logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in catch blocks.\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2153](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2153)\n\nThe model to use for image generation\n\n***\n\n### modelOptions?\n\n```ts\noptional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2169](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2169)\n\nModel-specific options for image generation\n\n***\n\n### numberOfImages?\n\n```ts\noptional numberOfImages?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2165](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2165)\n\nNumber of images to generate (default: 1)\n\n***\n\n### prompt\n\n```ts\nprompt: MediaPrompt;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2163](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2163)\n\nDescription of the desired image(s): a plain string, or an ordered array\nof content parts for image-conditioned generation (image-to-image,\nreference-guided, edit, multi-reference). Media parts may carry\n`metadata.role` to disambiguate intent (mask, control, reference, …).\nAdapters map parts onto the provider-native request — e.g. Gemini\nmultimodal `contents`, OpenAI `images.edit()`, fal `image_url` /\n`mask_url` — and throw a clear runtime error for unsupported modalities.\n\n***\n\n### size?\n\n```ts\noptional size?: TSize;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2167](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2167)\n\nImage size in WIDTHxHEIGHT format (e.g., \"1024x1024\")\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ImageGenerationOptions\ntitle: ImageGenerationOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2148](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2148)\n\nOptions for image generation.\nThese are the common options supported across providers.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `object`\n\n### TSize\n\n`TSize` *extends* `string` \\| `undefined` = `string`\n\n## Properties\n\n### abortSignal?\n\n```ts\noptional abortSignal?: AbortSignal;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2180](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2180)\n\nEffective abort signal composed by the activity from caller `abortSignal`\nand/or `timeout`. Adapters should forward this to the provider SDK when\nsupported. Request-specific — never store on a global client config.\n\n***\n\n### logger\n\n```ts\nlogger: InternalLogger;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2174](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2174)\n\nInternal logger threaded from the generateImage() entry point. Adapters must\ncall logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in catch blocks.\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2153](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2153)\n\nThe model to use for image generation\n\n***\n\n### modelOptions?\n\n```ts\noptional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2169](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2169)\n\nModel-specific options for image generation\n\n***\n\n### numberOfImages?\n\n```ts\noptional numberOfImages?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2165](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2165)\n\nNumber of images to generate (default: 1)\n\n***\n\n### prompt\n\n```ts\nprompt: MediaPrompt;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2163](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2163)\n\nDescription of the desired image(s): a plain string, or an ordered array\nof content parts for image-conditioned generation (image-to-image,\nreference-guided, edit, multi-reference). Media parts may carry\n`metadata.role` to disambiguate intent (mask, control, reference, …).\nAdapters map parts onto the provider-native request — e.g. Gemini\nmultimodal `contents`, OpenAI `images.edit()`, fal `image_url` /\n`mask_url` — and throw a clear runtime error for unsupported modalities.\n\n***\n\n### size?\n\n```ts\noptional size?: TSize;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2167](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2167)\n\nImage size in WIDTHxHEIGHT format (e.g., \"1024x1024\")\n"}
